{"name": "I Like Trains", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I Like Trains is a short idle incremental game about growing a single train line into a sprawling rail network. Pick up passengers and drop them off to earn resources. Reinvest in your network with new trains, stations, and upgrades as you build your network into a Tier 5 network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick up passengers and earn resources. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every passenger you move funds your next train, station, or upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/f8f41dbb040e9dc865a7df5d22cbb9fb.poster.avif?t=1787606203\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/f8f41dbb040e9dc865a7df5d22cbb9fb.webm?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/f8f41dbb040e9dc865a7df5d22cbb9fb.mp4?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost passenger spawn rate, boarding speed, train and station capacity, train speed, and fares. When you're ready, advance to the next tier and unlock new mechanics and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/6c5439926fa46997ccf4a5d4c34b0b99.poster.avif?t=1787606203\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/6c5439926fa46997ccf4a5d4c34b0b99.webm?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/6c5439926fa46997ccf4a5d4c34b0b99.mp4?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new resources and buildings to enhance the network and advance to the next class.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/59f13d06ce4b38373a8624301b7af6c8.poster.avif?t=1787606203\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/59f13d06ce4b38373a8624301b7af6c8.webm?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/extras/59f13d06ce4b38373a8624301b7af6c8.mp4?t=1787606203\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features coming in Full Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Tiers to progress through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 train lines with over 160 stations to build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-carriage cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New resources to manage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New buildings and upgrades</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "You like trains? Good, you are going to need a lot of them. Grow from a single train line into a sprawling transporation network in this incremental train game. Move passengers, invest in more trains, new lines, unlock new buildings and of course, buy lots of upgrades.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747490/35996a3